This C program initializes the pigpio library, opens the I2C bus, and logs the raw IR and RED ADC values from the Si1172 sensor to a CSV file named `biometric_log.csv`. It handles errors gracefully, distinguishing between transient I2C errors and a completely absent sensor. The program runs in an infinite loop, sampling once per second, and terminates upon receiving a SIGINT (Ctrl+C).

