This code captures a single frame from a USB camera at `/dev/video0`, applies a 5x5 box-blur filter, and saves the result as a JPEG. It uses the V4L2 MMAP API correctly, handles errors, and cleans up resources on all exit paths. It also handles SIGINT cleanly.

