This C program initializes the pigpio library and sets up the GPIO pins for the HC-SR04 ultrasonic sensor and the buzzer. It uses an interrupt handler to measure the distance and control the buzzer based on the distance measured. The program handles SIGINT (Ctrl+C) to terminate pigpio and exit cleanly.

