This C program reads differential pressure data from a Sensirion SDP800-500Pa sensor connected to I2C bus 1 on a Raspberry Pi 4 Model B. It uses the pigpio library to interact with the sensor, checks for errors, and logs the pressure readings along with timestamps to a CSV file named `airflow_log.csv`. The program handles sensor-absent or bus-error paths gracefully and ensures clean resource release on all exit paths, including graceful shutdown on SIGINT and SIGTERM.

