This C program initializes the pigpio library, opens an SPI channel, and sets up PWM on GPIO18. It reads temperature from the MAX31855 thermocouple amplifier every second, calculates the PWM duty cycle based on the temperature, and logs the readings into a circular buffer. On SIGINT, it stops PWM, closes the SPI channel, prints the log buffer, and terminates pigpio before exiting.

