This C program uses the libgpiod library to interface with a SainSmart TTP223B digital capacitive touch sensor and an LED on a Raspberry Pi 3 Model B+. It logs all touch events, errors, and startup/shutdown messages to the system syslog. The program gracefully handles SIGINT and SIGTERM signals to ensure the LED is turned off and resources are released before exiting.

