This C program implements a flame-detection safety system using the libgpiod API on a Raspberry Pi 3 Model B+. It polls a flame sensor connected to GPIO17 and activates a buzzer connected to GPIO18 when a flame is detected. The program logs events to 'alert_log.txt' and handles SIGINT and SIGTERM signals for graceful shutdown.

