This C program initializes the Adafruit LIS3MDL magnetometer on a Raspberry Pi 3 Model B+ over I2C, configures it for continuous-conversion mode, and continuously reads the magnetic field data. It writes the calibrated X, Y, Z values to 'magnetic_log.txt' at 10 Hz and checks for a threshold alert when the total field magnitude exceeds 800 mG. The program handles errors, retries initialization, and cleans up resources on signal termination.

