This C program uses the libgpiod API to control a relay connected to GPIO17 based on motion detection from an HC-SR501 PIR sensor connected to GPIO4. It logs all state transitions to the system journal via syslog and handles errors appropriately. The program also implements a clean shutdown on SIGINT/SIGTERM, ensuring the relay is driven LOW before releasing the GPIO line.

