This C program initializes the pigpio library, sets up the I2C communication with the MPU-6050 gyroscope, and configures the sensor for the desired operation. It reads the gyroscope data at 20 Hz, stores it in a circular buffer, and controls an LED on GPIO17 based on the gyroscope readings. The program handles errors during I2C operations and ensures a clean shutdown on receiving SIGINT or SIGTERM signals.

