This C program initializes the pigpio library and sets up an alert callback on GPIO17 (BCM) to capture pulse timings. It decodes the NEC IR remote signals, validates the checksum, and logs the decoded address and command to syslog. It also publishes each decoded command as JSON to an MQTT broker at localhost:1883 on topic `ir/decoded`. The program handles errors, guards against pulse buffer overflow, and cleanly releases resources on SIGINT or SIGTERM.

