This C program initializes the Adafruit AS7341 sensor over I2C, reads spectral data, computes a simplified lux approximation, and logs the results with a timestamp to `spectral_log.csv` every 5 seconds. It handles errors and ensures proper resource release on all exit paths, including SIGINT.

