This C program initializes the pigpio library, sets up the GPIO pins for the Keywish 3-Way Tracking Sensor, and reads the sensor states at a 10 Hz rate. It logs the sensor states to the console and sends an "EMERGENCY STOP!" message over the serial port if all sensors detect an obstacle simultaneously. It also handles SIGINT and SIGTERM signals to gracefully stop the program and release resources.
